---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/ui/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import PageIntro from '../../components/ui/PageIntro.astro';
import LoanVsInvestmentIsland from '../../features/calculators/LoanVsInvestmentIsland';
import { getBreadcrumbsForPath } from '../../config/routes';

const crumbs = getBreadcrumbsForPath('/tools/loan-vs-invest/');
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Prepay Loan vs Invest Decision Simulator — Ant Wealth Creation"
  description="Compare the financial trade-offs between aggressively prepaying a home loan versus investing surplus cash flow into diversified mutual funds."
  currentPath="/tools/loan-vs-invest/"
>
  <div class="container page-container">
    <Breadcrumbs crumbs={crumbs} />

    <PageIntro
      eyebrow="Decision Framework"
      title="Prepay Loan vs Invest Decision Simulator"
      description="Resolve the classic personal finance dilemma: Should you use surplus funds to pay off your home loan early, or invest them into equity markets? Compare guaranteed interest savings against compounding wealth."
      statusBadge="Interactive Calculator Active • Arbitrage Analysis"
    />

    <!-- Interactive Concept C Loan vs Investment Trade-off Island -->
    <LoanVsInvestmentIsland client:load />

    <section class="educational-insight-box" aria-labelledby="matrix-heading">
      <h2 id="matrix-heading" class="section-title">The Strategic Trade-Off Matrix</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        The choice between loan prepayment and investing involves more than just rate comparison—it balances peace of mind against long-term liquidity:
      </p>

      <div class="decision-grid">
        <div class="decision-card">
          <span class="decision-badge">Option A: Prepay Loan</span>
          <h3 class="decision-title">Guaranteed & Debt-Free Peace of Mind</h3>
          <ul class="decision-list">
            <li><strong>Guaranteed Return:</strong> Every rupee prepaid yields an immediate, risk-free saving equal to your effective loan interest rate.</li>
            <li><strong>Reduced Fixed Burden:</strong> Prepaying shortens tenure or lowers EMI, reducing recurring financial vulnerability.</li>
            <li><strong>Emotional Freedom:</strong> Unencumbering your primary family home provides significant psychological security.</li>
            <li><strong>Critical Trade-off:</strong> Cash is permanently locked into home equity. You cannot easily access home equity for health emergencies or opportunities without taking a new loan.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="decision-card optimal-choice">
          <span class="decision-badge">Option B: Invest Surplus</span>
          <h3 class="decision-title">Long-Term Wealth & Complete Liquidity</h3>
          <ul class="decision-list">
            <li><strong>Potential Compounding Arbitrage:</strong> Historically, diversified equity returns have outpaced mortgage rates over 10+ year horizons.</li>
            <li><strong>Complete Liquidity:</strong> Mutual fund investments remain accessible to protect your family against emergencies or job transitions.</li>
            <li><strong>Asset Diversification:</strong> Balances family wealth instead of concentrating the majority of net worth into real estate.</li>
            <li><strong>Critical Trade-off:</strong> Returns are market-linked and volatile. Short-term declines can test psychological discipline.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 5 Core Decision Factors -->
    <section class="framework-section" aria-labelledby="framework-heading">
      <h2 id="framework-heading" class="section-title">5 Foundational Pillars for Making Your Decision</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        Before directing surplus cash flow toward either prepayment or investments, evaluate these five structural criteria:
      </p>

      <div class="pillars-grid">
        <div class="pillar-card">
          <div class="pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">🛡️</div>
          <h3 class="pillar-title">1. Emergency Liquidity First</h3>
          <p class="pillar-desc">
            Never prepay a home loan using your core emergency buffer. Ensure your family has at least 6 months of mandatory living expenses plus EMIs safely parked in liquid instruments before considering extra principal prepayments.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar-card">
          <div class="pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">⏱️</div>
          <h3 class="pillar-title">2. Loan Tenure & Life Stage</h3>
          <p class="pillar-desc">
            Interest comprises the highest portion of EMI in the first 5 to 7 years of a loan. Prepayment has its greatest mathematical impact early in the tenure. In later years, continuing to invest often provides superior compounding.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar-card">
          <div class="pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">⚖️</div>
          <h3 class="pillar-title">3. Hurdle Rate Comparison</h3>
          <p class="pillar-desc">
            The effective cost of borrowing is your hurdle rate. If your home loan is at 8.5% p.a., your investment portfolio must reliably generate higher post-tax returns over the same horizon to justify investing surplus capital.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar-card">
          <div class="pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">📜</div>
          <h3 class="pillar-title">4. Tax Deduction Landscape</h3>
          <p class="pillar-desc">
            Under the Old Tax Regime, Section 24(b) permits interest deductions up to ₹2 Lakhs for self-occupied homes, reducing effective borrowing cost. Under the New Tax Regime (Section 115BAC), this deduction is absent, elevating effective cost.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar-card">
          <div class="pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">🧠</div>
          <h3 class="pillar-title">5. Psychological Risk Tolerance</h3>
          <p class="pillar-desc">
            Numbers alone do not tell the whole story. If debt causes anxiety, prepaying provides guaranteed emotional relief. If market fluctuations cause panic selling, equity investments may not realize their long-term potential.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar-card">
          <div class="pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">🔄</div>
          <h3 class="pillar-title">The Balanced Hybrid Strategy</h3>
          <p class="pillar-desc">
            You do not have to pick only one path. Many resilient households split surplus cash flow 50/50: directing one half toward annual principal prepayment and the other half into long-term SIP compounding.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Key Decision Factors: Prepayment vs Investing -->
    <section class="tax-considerations-section" aria-labelledby="considerations-heading">
      <div class="considerations-box">
        <h2 id="considerations-heading" class="considerations-title">Key Decision Factors: Prepayment vs Investing</h2>
        <p class="considerations-desc">
          When comparing loan prepayment with long-term investment, keep the following core financial dynamics in mind:
        </p>
        <ul class="considerations-list">
          <li><strong>Guaranteed vs Expected Returns:</strong> Loan prepayment delivers guaranteed, risk-free savings equal to the loan interest rate. Equity investments offer potentially higher returns over 10+ year horizons but carry market volatility.</li>
          <li><strong>Liquidity & Flexibility:</strong> Money prepaid into a loan reduces debt but cannot be easily re-borrowed in emergencies. Mutual fund investments remain liquid and accessible.</li>
          <li><strong>Tax Implications:</strong> Home loan interest deduction under Section 24(b) (Old Regime) reduces the effective cost of borrowing. Similarly, long-term capital gains on equities are subject to Section 112A taxation.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="considerations-footer">
          This calculator provides educational mathematical comparisons. Consult a qualified financial advisor to tailor strategy to your family's exact cash flow and tax status.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Connected Working Tools -->
    <section class="connected-tools-section" aria-labelledby="tools-heading">
      <h2 id="tools-heading" class="section-title">Explore Our Live Financial Calculators</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        Explore our other operational debt and investment calculators:
      </p>

      <div class="tools-grid">
        <a href="/tools/home-loan-foreclosure/" class="tool-link-card">
          <span class="tool-link-badge">Live Calculator</span>
          <h3 class="tool-link-title">Home Loan Foreclosure vs SIP</h3>
          <p class="tool-link-desc">
            Simulate how making systematic extra principal payments shortens your tenure and saves substantial interest.
          </p>
          <span class="tool-link-action">Launch Prepayment Calculator →</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/tools/loan-sip-recovery/" class="tool-link-card">
          <span class="tool-link-badge">Live Calculator</span>
          <h3 class="tool-link-title">Loan Interest Recovery SIP</h3>
          <p class="tool-link-desc">
            Model how running a parallel mutual fund SIP alongside your home loan can build a corpus to offset borrowing costs.
          </p>
          <span class="tool-link-action">Launch Recovery Calculator →</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/health-check/" class="tool-link-card">
          <span class="tool-link-badge">Live Diagnostic</span>
          <h3 class="tool-link-title">7-Pillar Financial Health Check</h3>
          <p class="tool-link-desc">
            Assess your family's overall debt burden, liquidity buffers, and financial solvency in 2 minutes.
          </p>
          <span class="tool-link-action">Start Health Check →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="nav-links-strip">
      <a href="/tools/home-loan-foreclosure/" class="btn-subtle">← Home Loan Prepayment Calculator</a>
      <a href="/tools/loan-sip-recovery/" class="btn-subtle">Explore Loan + SIP Recovery →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-container {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-16);
  }

  .educational-insight-box,
  .framework-section,
  .tax-considerations-section,
  .connected-tools-section {
    margin: var(--space-12) 0;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: var(--text-h2);
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-brand-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .section-desc {
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .decision-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .decision-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .decision-card {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);
  }

  .optimal-choice {
    border-color: var(--primitive-teal-500);
    border-width: 2px;
    background-color: var(--primitive-teal-50);
  }

  .decision-badge {
    font-size: var(--text-caption);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-brand);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .decision-title {
    font-size: var(--text-h4);
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-brand-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .decision-list {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: var(--space-5);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    font-size: var(--text-body-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .pillars-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .pillars-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .pillars-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .pillar-card {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .pillar-icon {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
  }

  .pillar-title {
    font-size: var(--text-h4);
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-brand-primary);
  }

  .pillar-desc {
    font-size: var(--text-body-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .considerations-box {
    background-color: var(--primitive-gold-50);
    border: 1px solid var(--primitive-gold-100);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--primitive-gold-500);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-6);
  }

  .considerations-title {
    font-size: var(--text-h4);
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-accent);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .considerations-desc {
    font-size: var(--text-body-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .considerations-list {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4) 0;
    padding-left: var(--space-5);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    font-size: var(--text-body-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .considerations-footer {
    font-size: var(--text-caption);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-accent);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .tools-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .tools-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .tool-link-card {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    text-decoration: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    transition: transform var(--transition-fast), box-shadow var(--transition-fast), border-color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .tool-link-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);
    border-color: var(--color-brand-primary);
  }

  .tool-link-badge {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--color-text-brand);
    background-color: var(--primitive-teal-50);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  .tool-link-title {
    font-size: var(--text-h4);
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-brand-primary);
  }

  .tool-link-desc {
    font-size: var(--text-body-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
    flex: 1;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .tool-link-action {
    font-size: var(--text-body-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-brand);
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }

  .nav-links-strip {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    padding-top: var(--space-8);
    margin-top: var(--space-12);
  }

  .btn-subtle {
    font-size: var(--text-body-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-brand);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-4);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .btn-subtle:hover {
    background-color: var(--primitive-teal-50);
    border-color: var(--primitive-teal-100);
  }
</style>
